# Role-separated ACL template for DriftGuard-Kafka M10.1.
# Replace `driftguard/demo` with your private namespace token.

# 1) Wokwi ESP32 device identity: may publish telemetry/heartbeat and subscribe to commands.
user wokwi_device
topic write driftguard/demo/+/telemetry
topic write driftguard/demo/+/heartbeat
topic read driftguard/demo/+/command

# 2) Mac local backend (MQTT-Kafka bridge + Dashboard Publisher):
#    reads raw device streams, sends device commands, publishes verified dashboard state.
user mac_backend
topic read driftguard/demo/+/telemetry
topic read driftguard/demo/+/heartbeat
topic write driftguard/demo/+/command
topic write driftguard/demo/dashboard/#

# 3) Streamlit Community Cloud viewer: strictly read-only on verified dashboard topics.
user streamlit_readonly
topic read driftguard/demo/dashboard/#
